==Spanish==

===Pronunciation===
{{es-pr}}

===Noun===
{{es-noun|m-p}}

# [[thousands]]
#: {{syn|es|millares}}
#: {{uxi|es|hace '''miles''' de años|'''thousands''' of years ago}}

====Usage notes====
* ''Miles'' is only used in the indefinite sense of the word "thousands":
*: {{uxi|es|'''miles''' de pesos|'''thousands''' of pesos}}

* Otherwise, the singular ''mil'' is used:
*: {{uxi|es|dos '''mil''' pesos|two '''thousand''' pesos" ($2,000)}}
*: {{uxi|es|cien '''mil''' pesos|a hundred '''thousand''' pesos" ($100,000)}}

